msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ahh, my military texts.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You haven’t read ⟪k:4⟫all⟪k:5⟫ of them, have you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아아, ⟪k:2⟫병법서 말이냐?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫설마 ⟪k:5⟫내 방 책을 다 읽었어?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_62DBB3DF_E5B4_407B_90A4_875CD1712EC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2861626a9e035c50fe203e6945fb5b89637d9d0898d524f44aba5f24bffef002
