msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Impressive. Even I haven’t read all the books in my room.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You planning to join "
"the order with that kind of knowledge?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나도 다 읽지 않았는데. ⟪k:2⟫열정적이구나.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫잔뜩 공부해서 ⟪k:5⟫입대라도 하려고?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2C314B5_C157_41AE_94D7_31D8286AD6DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 234696e2c5cd9d4b2f99f497a8efb327af17522c5e96285b1c01058a597125af
#. default-sha256: 61ba4d51b9dc39b7d6a70b95529236120cdf82273efaa8db45870168cd85b527
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2C314B5_C157_41AE_94D7_31D8286AD6DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You jest.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re the one who’s going to be a knight, Didier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……농담은 삼가 주십시오.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫기사가 되는 건 형님 아니십니까."

#: scenario7:scenario7_67E43141_7094_494E_AD88_FF6FF67DA053
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 690b7cbbdd3e9ae4e71355ab34ddb3d4beac09d6e6278d2dc7b3cbd0582585bb
#. default-sha256: 5786284f75431bd7115aa6e02b061d29aef7d8ad19210fc4a41c38d9f75608ba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_67E43141_7094_494E_AD88_FF6FF67DA053"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Haha, that I am. ⟪k:2⟫War ⟪k:3⟫is⟪k:4⟫ the men’s job, after all.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"I want you to be there to welcome me home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫하하, ⟪k:2⟫하긴. ⟪k:3⟫싸움과 전쟁은 남자 역할이지.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫너는 ⟪k:6⟫내가 귀환하길 기다"
"려 주면 좋겠어――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_31BE9686_88DC_43B7_8BD3_7F78C84DE094
