msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6A53B4BE_CC02_4099_8581_D8BFEFF735B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abaf803954044594aba19658752b2685987af97c39570b6b44c06b1f402461ae
#. default-sha256: b6f3479a46e45f10a4ba1975a9328bccea0c88a121a9ff070efa25470e4eba26
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6A53B4BE_CC02_4099_8581_D8BFEFF735B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Didier! Oh Diiiidieeeer!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m in a bit of a bind, could— ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Oh, hello there, Michelle!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이봐아, ⟪k:4⟫디디에! ⟪k:5⟫디디에 형! ⟪k:6⟫좀 곤란한 일이 터졌는데―― 어, ⟪k:7⟫"
"미셸도 있었어?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_996A59B2_B4EA_4FBB_9EF4_C81F9030A454
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31594c96561c493651e1b52ff30dc6775b203ddc969d6d3ef11519183f3493f4
