msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫G-⟪k:6⟫Get away from the board!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫머, ⟪k:6⟫멈춰!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_09DFDE46_6D2D_4CE8_92A9_44E280B4AFD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf5d33e99dc88a5eecc97882656f96b95fdb891398d3be33228b68cbc082025b
#. default-sha256: 46dbb55db5301513b15643472db01a3136a7c0510a5ec548c1bde0b7458eab2c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09DFDE46_6D2D_4CE8_92A9_44E280B4AFD4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Yiiiikes, you got ⟪k:5⟫trounced⟪k:6⟫, huh.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And you call "
"yourself her big brother! Ahaha!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫으햐~, ⟪k:5⟫아주 호되게도 깨졌구만.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫형 체면이 박살났어! ⟪k:8⟫아"
"하하!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7B2A7768_FBDD_4390_B6B4_666D83D299D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b906b5d788abafe0dab199382ac642b15b8922f3bbdc415b5a2130022dae4ba
#. default-sha256: 5701145c6de180165b0f7e799122022198df102835e47a01ffe9f26136397ee4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7B2A7768_FBDD_4390_B6B4_666D83D299D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫As if you’re any better!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그러는 네 실력도 시원찮잖냐!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0D34DBE_24A5_4A5D_8467_F8709C64AE01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21b61d35807c6261dbe210bf083ca2a72874e8bef8f40abd15f0dad42aeed3c5
#. default-sha256: 2a2f6e005d79a32cc2f7265da66e4d61ff36d5f62e3c61b2a5c976fb0adab481
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0D34DBE_24A5_4A5D_8467_F8709C64AE01"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s not funny, Georges.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I cannot approve of someone who can’t keep up with "
"the flow of battle becoming a knight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫웃을 일이 아닙니다. ⟪k:2⟫저는 전황을 못 읽는 분이 기사가 되는 건 반대합니다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_38D4C3CB_2A8A_41BE_9801_699F717ECD69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65fe1d256a926e4693115e70f2506c3bdd53060917be5d83435b9e0b2c37d358
#. default-sha256: e08f1a652cc3bf056bb2b1c972e8fe146acc8451b19ca644a792256f4b85dd28
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_38D4C3CB_2A8A_41BE_9801_699F717ECD69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Given our family’s rank, you would eventually be put in charge of other soldiers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫우리 집안 이름이 있으니, ⟪k:2⟫장차 병사들을 통솔할 입장이 되실 거 아닙니까?"

