msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_638139D8_135C_4AAA_86B3_F046485B7999"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And among other things, they taught me how to read and write.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For a girl, I was "
"incredibly fortunate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫문자를 읽고 쓰는 법과 ⟪k:1⟫각종 지식도 ⟪k:2⟫두 형이 내게 가르쳤다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫여자 몸으로는 "
"⟪k:5⟫충분히 복받은 입장이리라."

#: scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6200b34bee7b2c547103052f364abb7a445193c9d7e2262caca10f6ea901f04e
#. default-sha256: 9e13e97d81702301579629322d08fee6b155f7cd625f82862572649720c4a70b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The one thing I wasn’t allowed to do, though, was hold a sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 유일하게 ⟪k:1⟫허락받지 못 한 것이 ⟪k:2⟫검을 쥐는 것.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫당연하긴 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_22C434B2_4CF3_4B38_B305_E352B14E7470
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27552ead2ac109518f3b44247c7fd37edfa7adefe14ce120eb155f67a4c5dfbe
