msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I had been told I couldn’t do it because I lacked the strength,⟪k:1⟫I probably would have "
"accepted it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는 몸이 약하니 ⟪k:1⟫무기를 못 쥔다고 했다면, ⟪k:2⟫나는 아마 납득했으리라."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7C983434_7E1C_4DA1_979E_74604548F401
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69045636f30f727b02c13daf360d31b69e662fa0cd9e24ba6b33e839a73a6bac
#. default-sha256: 7e73f8e2e4628ed0ac3bf43ceb65d7848ad3d0a0f2a9ecf43752d0e91cad5b1e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7C983434_7E1C_4DA1_979E_74604548F401"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the reason given was not that I was weak—⟪k:1⟫but that I was a girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 무기를 못 쥐는 이유는 ⟪k:1⟫내 체질 때문이 아니라――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 성별 때문이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_600D3ABE_49B0_4D6B_9593_986056A7D486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3bc7667330d7ff02de507e6cf51c765c521c0a46d8f15e2343a06b158f0715f
