msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AE1738F_0DA1_4979_B20A_085EC32027FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Now, come.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I would rather you looked at some fine embroidery with me than "
"a couple of sweaty men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫자, ⟪k:3⟫가자꾸나? ⟪k:4⟫저런 땀내 나는 거 말고, ⟪k:5⟫예쁜 자수를 보여 줄게."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1D59474D_9500_47E7_8F45_EC4626759061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2430cb8ab1b3f6b04481fa7297a89b891b2a0152b97318ffb42d590efeb10341
